# Waking Dreams (battlefield.waking_dreams#helper, The Shrouded Maw): Party of four at the entry: main (quest accepted,
# vial), bob (quest completed, vial), cat (quest accepted, no vial), dan (vial, no quest). bob enters with the eighth
# parameter 5; cat and dan are refused with a release only. The win gives main and bob their 32001 (bob with the eighth
# argument 5). The finishes of main and bob answer message 6398 (the battlefield's onEventFinishWin, WakingDreams.cs).
lists TheShroudedMaw/MC_Entrance/onTrigger TheShroudedMaw/onEventUpdate/32000 TheShroudedMaw/onEventFinish/32000 TheShroudedMaw/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char dan zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
quest Windurst.WakingDreams accepted
keyitem VialOfDreamIncense
bob: quest Windurst.WakingDreams completed
bob: keyitem VialOfDreamIncense
cat: quest Windurst.WakingDreams accepted
dan: keyitem VialOfDreamIncense
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
trigger MC_Entrance
update 32000 option=33
finish
bob: trigger MC_Entrance
bob: update 32000 option=33
bob: finish
cat: trigger MC_Entrance
cat: update 32000 option=33
cat: finish
dan: trigger MC_Entrance
dan: update 32000 option=33
dan: finish
tick 2000
kill DIABOLOS_WD
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
tick 11000
